|----------|-------|--------|
| 🔴 CRITICAL | 1 | Hardcoded credentials in .env.test |
| 🟠 HIGH | 4 | No input validation, missing security headers, no auth, no CORS |
| 🟡 MEDIUM | 3 | No rate limiting, unvalidated data, content validation |
| 🔵 LOW | 2 | Insufficient logging, port exposure |

**Recommended Actions (Priority Order):**
